{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39773","headline":"投翰长赵侍郎 · 黄滔","name":"投翰长赵侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禹门西面逐飘蓬，忽喜仙都得入踪。\n贾氏许频趋季虎，荀家因敢谒头龙。\n手扶日月重轮起，数是乾坤正气锺。\n五色笔驱神出没，八花塼接帝从容。\n诗酬御制风骚古，论似人情鼎鼐浓。\n岂有地能先凤掖，别无山更胜鳌峰。\n攀鸿日浅魂飞越，爲鲤年深势噞喁。\n泽国雨荒三径草，秦关雪折一枝筇。\n吹成暖景犹葭律，引上纤萝在岳松。\n愿向明朝荐幽滞，免教号泣触登庸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39773.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39773","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}